@page "/"
<PageTitle>Standalone sample — Blazor Profiler</PageTitle>
<h1>Standalone WebAssembly</h1>
<p>A Blazor WebAssembly app without a server project: the interactive router reports every navigation, so the profiler
   can relate memory and timers to page visits. Open the dashboard with Alt+Shift+P.</p>
<button id="count" @onclick="() => count++">Clicked @count time(s)</button>
@code {
    private int count;
}
